      "hardware_label": "Intel Arc Pro B70",
      "notes": "First public run of this model? nemotron_h_moe (hybrid Mamba2+attn+MoE, 75B/9B-active) cannot load on mainline llama.cpp; requires the puzzle-port fork PLUS a local 4-file patch adding SSM_SCAN d_state=96 Vulkan pipelines (without it: ~3.5 t/s CPU fallback; with it: 39 t/s, ~11x). Decode: llama-bench tg64 r=5, 7 clean reps 38.90-39.33. Prefill: pp2048, tuned -ub 1024 -ts 0.9/1 (default gives 947). -sm layer only (tensor-split gated off upstream for hybrid archs; Vulkan lacks row-split). Sched pipeline parallelism active (copies=4). GPUs are SR-IOV VFs: power draw not measurable (sysman PF-only). Sustained-serving caveat: long-lived multi-GPU decode sags ~4x over ~6 requests without a periodic chunky GPU burst (clock-governor behavior); single-GPU immune. Mesa 26.1.4 (kisak), kernel 7.0.0-28.",
